#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:1
msgid "2 · Specify the model"
msgstr "2 · Menspesifikasikan model"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:3
msgid "Choose the family, the auxiliary variables, the area identifier and, if needed, the priors."
msgstr "Pilih family, variabel penyerta, identitas area, dan jika perlu, prior."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:5
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You need a DataFrame from {doc}`01-load-data`. Specifying a model does not sample, so every call on this page returns immediately."
msgstr "Anda membutuhkan DataFrame dari {doc}`01-load-data`. Menspesifikasikan model tidak melakukan sampling, sehingga setiap pemanggilan di halaman ini langsung selesai."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:10
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Kerjakan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:12
msgid "Three interfaces build the same model. Use the simplest one that can express yours."
msgstr "Tiga antarmuka membangun model yang sama. Gunakan yang paling sederhana yang dapat menyatakan model Anda."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "Function"
msgstr "Fungsi"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "You pass"
msgstr "Yang Anda isi"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "Use it when"
msgstr "Gunakan ketika"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "Beginner"
msgstr "Pemula"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "`hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_beta`, `hbm_binomial`"
msgstr "`hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_beta`, `hbm_binomial`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "response, auxiliary variables, the family's own columns"
msgstr "respons, variabel penyerta, kolom khusus family"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "the response fits one of the three families"
msgstr "respons cocok dengan salah satu dari tiga family"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "Intermediate"
msgstr "Menengah"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "`hbm_flex`"
msgstr "`hbm_flex`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "the same, plus `family=`"
msgstr "sama, ditambah `family=`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "the family is chosen in code, for example in a loop"
msgstr "family dipilih di dalam kode, misalnya dalam perulangan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Mahir"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "`create_model` (R alias `hbm`)"
msgstr "`create_model` (alias R `hbm`)"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "a formula"
msgstr "sebuah formula"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md
msgid "you need a random-effect term other than `(1|group)`, such as a random slope `(x1|group)`"
msgstr "Anda membutuhkan suku efek acak selain `(1|group)`, misalnya kemiringan acak `(x1|group)`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:20
msgid "The same Fay-Herriot model, built three ways:"
msgstr "Model Fay-Herriot yang sama, dibangun dengan tiga cara:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:43
msgid "The area identifier (`area_var=` or `group=`) adds the area random effect `(1|group)`."
msgstr "Identitas area (`area_var=` atau `group=`) menambahkan efek acak area `(1|group)`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:45
msgid "Each family needs its own survey-design columns:"
msgstr "Setiap family membutuhkan kolom desain surveinya sendiri:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "Family"
msgstr "Family"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "Beginner interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka tingkat pemula"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr "Argumen"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "Gaussian"
msgstr "Gaussian"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "`hbm_gaussian`"
msgstr "`hbm_gaussian`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "`sampling_var=`, the sampling variance"
msgstr "`sampling_var=`, varians sampling"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "Beta"
msgstr "Beta"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "`hbm_beta`"
msgstr "`hbm_beta`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "`n=` and `deff=`, the sample size and design effect"
msgstr "`n=` dan `deff=`, ukuran sampel dan efek desain"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "Binomial"
msgstr "Binomial"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "`hbm_binomial`"
msgstr "`hbm_binomial`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:37
msgid "`trials=`, the number of trials"
msgstr "`trials=`, jumlah percobaan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:53
msgid "Every auxiliary variable must be a column name. Compute transformations and interactions in the DataFrame first:"
msgstr "Setiap variabel penyerta harus berupa nama kolom. Hitung transformasi dan interaksi di DataFrame terlebih dahulu:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:68
msgid "Set priors"
msgstr "Menetapkan prior"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:70
msgid "Without `priors=`, Bambi's default priors are used; they are scaled to the data. To set your own, pass a `Prior` per term:"
msgstr "Tanpa `priors=`, prior bawaan Bambi yang dipakai; prior ini diskalakan terhadap data. Untuk menetapkan prior sendiri, berikan satu `Prior` per suku:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:80
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{doc}`03-check-priors` shows whether the priors are reasonable."
msgstr "{doc}`03-check-priors` menunjukkan apakah prior tersebut wajar."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:82
msgid "Pin a known parameter"
msgstr "Menetapkan parameter yang sudah diketahui"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:84
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`fixed_params=` fixes a parameter to a known value instead of estimating it: `{\"sigma\": ...}` for Gaussian, `{\"kappa\": ...}` for Beta. The value is a column name or a number, on the parameter's own scale:"
msgstr "`fixed_params=` menetapkan sebuah parameter ke nilai yang sudah diketahui alih-alih mengestimasinya: `{\"sigma\": ...}` untuk Gaussian, `{\"kappa\": ...}` untuk Beta. Nilainya berupa nama kolom atau angka, pada skala parameter itu sendiri:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:99
msgid "`sampling_var=` already pins `sigma`, so a Gaussian model takes one or the other."
msgstr "`sampling_var=` sudah menetapkan `sigma`, sehingga model Gaussian hanya menerima salah satunya."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:101
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:103
msgid "`summary()` describes the model before fitting:"
msgstr "`summary()` mendeskripsikan model sebelum fitting:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:117
msgid "`Formula` is the formula that will be fitted."
msgstr "`Formula` adalah formula yang akan di-fit."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:118
msgid "`n` is the number of areas left after rows with missing values are dropped."
msgstr "`n` adalah jumlah area yang tersisa setelah baris dengan nilai hilang dibuang."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:119
msgid "`Config` holds the sampler settings."
msgstr "`Config` memuat pengaturan sampler."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:121
msgid "`check_data()` runs the data pipeline and returns the frame the model will use:"
msgstr "`check_data()` menjalankan pipeline data dan mengembalikan frame yang akan dipakai model:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:134
msgid "`log_sqrt_D` is the Fay-Herriot offset computed from `sampling_var`."
msgstr "`log_sqrt_D` adalah offset Fay-Herriot yang dihitung dari `sampling_var`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:136
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jika gagal"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:138
msgid "Each of these errors is raised before any sampling."
msgstr "Setiap galat berikut muncul sebelum sampling apa pun."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:140
msgid "**The family is unknown.**"
msgstr "**Family tidak dikenali.**"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:155
msgid "**A formula column is not in the data.** `check_data()` and `fit()` raise it, and `err.context` lists the missing names:"
msgstr "**Kolom dalam formula tidak ada di data.** `check_data()` dan `fit()` memunculkannya, dan `err.context` mencantumkan nama yang hilang:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:171
msgid "**An argument belongs to another family.**"
msgstr "**Argumen milik family lain.**"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:184
msgid "**A formula term is not a column name.** With `group=`, construction raises it. Without `group=`, `check_data()` or `fit()` does."
msgstr "**Suku formula bukan nama kolom.** Dengan `group=`, galat muncul saat konstruksi. Tanpa `group=`, galat muncul di `check_data()` atau `fit()`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:200
msgid "**A parameter is pinned twice.**"
msgstr "**Parameter ditetapkan dua kali.**"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:214
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:216
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Why there are three interfaces: {doc}`../explanation/three-tier-api`."
msgstr "Mengapa ada tiga antarmuka: {doc}`../explanation/three-tier-api`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/02-specify-model.md:217
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Which columns each family accepts: {doc}`../explanation/family-registry`."
msgstr "Kolom yang diterima setiap family: {doc}`../explanation/family-registry`."

